{"code":0,"message":"success","resultList":[{"topicId":"0208219932397903413","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0308219932397903414","parentPostId":"0","authorId":"7a6504ae76134ff4a0b5a74b5aef5a74","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":1,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><span>我是electerm（windows/Linux(Loongarch)/MacOS）（<a class=\"autoSetLinkTag\" href=\"cid:link_0\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/electerm/electerm</a>）的作者，最近刚移植了electerm到Android，就是运行nodejs web服务，在webview里打开界面, harmony 可以实现吗，有计划支持吗</span></div>","createTime":"20260720041957","updateTime":"20260813182605","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[{"title":"","href":"https://github.com/electerm/electerm","name":"link_0"}],"lastEditTime":"20260720041957","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":0,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":0,"displayOfficial":0,"ipHomeArea":"吉林","quality":0},{"topicId":"0208219932397903413","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0303220293445034517","parentPostId":"0308219932397903414","authorId":"7178da36286c405aba0e245de18c62d8","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><p>要先区分目标是 HarmonyOS PC 还是手机/平板 HAP。PC 侧如果走 Electron 适配路线，整体思路接近把现有 Electron 工程搬到鸿蒙 Electron 壳里，再处理 native module、路径、窗口和系统能力差异。</p>  <p/>  <p>如果目标是普通 HarmonyOS 应用内用 ArkWeb 承载界面，就不建议默认假设可以像桌面一样长期运行一个本地 Node Web 服务。HAP 里后台进程、端口监听、文件系统、native 模块、PTY/SSH 等都有生命周期和沙箱限制。</p>  <p/>  <p>对 electerm 这类项目，更可控的迁移路线是：前端 UI 尽量复用为 H5/ArkWeb 或 ArkUI；核心能力如 ssh、sftp、pty、终端渲染、密钥管理拆成 ArkTS/NAPI/Native 能力；WebView 只负责界面展示。这样比“启动 Node 服务再打开本地页面”更符合移动端和鸿蒙应用模型。</p></div>","createTime":"20260724083725","updateTime":"20260813175553","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[],"lastEditTime":"20260724083725","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":2,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":0,"displayOfficial":0,"ipHomeArea":"四川","quality":0},{"topicId":"0208219932397903413","sectionId":"0109140870620153026","postId":"0301220025407257426","parentPostId":"0308219932397903414","authorId":"b227b29d387548119f16a05c63d0dfeb","status":2,"deleted":0,"ext":"","first":0,"solved":0,"likes":0,"attachments":0,"content":"<div class=\"cke-article\"><span style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">尊敬的开发者，您好，<br/>关于您的反馈的问题，</span><br/>现有Electron项目适配HarmonyOS是完全可行的。<br/>适配核心思路是：将原始Electron项目的编译产物同步到鸿蒙Electron工程壳中，替换不兼容的Native模块，最终通过DevEco Studio构建为HAP包<br/><span style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">该问题可以参考的文档如下：</span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">已有Electron项目，如何适配HarmonyOS PC：<a href=\"cid:link_0\" target=\"_self\">https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/forum/topic/0202206298304106575?fid=0109140870620153026</a></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Electron使用三方库：<a href=\"cid:link_1\" target=\"_self\">https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/forum/topic/0202207503700743878</a></span></div><div><br/><br/><span style=\"font-size: 16.0px;\">合作愉快。<br/>华为开发者联盟</span></div></div>","createTime":"20260721061007","updateTime":"20260813172809","attachmentInfoList":[],"uploadInfoList":[],"hrefInfoList":[{"title":"","href":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/forum/topic/0202206298304106575?fid=0109140870620153026","name":"link_0"},{"title":"","href":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/forum/topic/0202207503700743878","name":"link_1"}],"lastEditTime":"20260721061007","anonymous":0,"replyTotal":0,"channel":1,"floor":1,"adopted":0,"recommended":0,"officialReply":1,"displayOfficial":1,"ipHomeArea":"广东","quality":0}],"totalCount":3}